ill </c><00:00:01.242><c>have </c><00:00:01.243><c>no </c><00:00:01.244><c>effect  </c><00:00:01.245><c>on </c><00:00:01.246><c>the </c><00:00:01.247><c>rate </c><00:00:01.248><c>of </c><00:00:01.249><c>the </c><00:00:01.250><c>reaction </c><00:00:01.251><c>and  </c><00:00:01.252><c>therefore  </c><00:00:01.253><c>this </c><00:00:01.254><c>reaction </c><00:00:01.255><c>the </c><00:00:01.256><c>decomposition </c><00:00:01.257><c>of  </c><00:00:01.258><c>ammonia </c><00:00:01.259><c>on </c><00:00:01.260><c>a </c><00:00:01.261><c>hot </c><00:00:01.262><c>platinum </c><00:00:01.263><c>surface  </c><00:00:01.264><c>is </c><00:00:01.265><c>an </c><00:00:01.266><c>example </c><00:00:01.267><c>of </c><00:00:01.268><c>a </c><00:00:01.269><c>zero </c><00:00:01.270><c>order </c><00:00:01.271><c>reaction</c>

